# Mammals' sleep: msleep

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:giggly, path: Path.join(__DIR__, "..")},
  {:kino, "~> 0.19"}
  ])
```

## About this notebook

ggplot2's reference page for [`msleep`](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/msleep.html) has
no examples, so this notebook says only what the page describes and where Giggly stands.

`msleep` is an updated and expanded version of the mammals sleep dataset: 83 mammals, each with
its common name, genus, order, diet, conservation status, hours of total and REM sleep, length of
sleep cycle, hours awake, and brain and body weight in kilograms. The updated sleep times and
weights come from Savage and West (2007); the order, conservation status and diet were added from
Wikipedia. Not in Giggly yet: the `msleep` dataset; `Giggly.Datasets` has ggplot2's `mpg` and R's
`mtcars` only.
